window.products.push({"id":1172045,"name":"DIVEROID Waterproof Phone Case – Easy to Use Underwater Camera, Diving Computer, All-in-One Diving Gear, Universal Size","category":"electronics","retail price":428.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uPQAfyaTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The DIVEROID includes the Mini, a small dive computer waterproof phone case up to 200ft. It will help you to prevent accidents by measuring depth and dive duration. The only existing dive computer with an all-in-one solution with no water leakage Featuring four camera modes; zoom, wide, ultra wide angle, and selfie with various angles. With these four waterproof camera modes, it can be used as an underwater fishing camera with Double O-rings that prevent water leakage It has a synced logbook of your photos with depth information, so you can easily go back and view your photos with the times and depths at which they were taken. You can also share your logbook easily on social media or through a text message It supports free diving mode with features including depth alarm, stopwatch for static apnea, and even convenient boat calling straight from the app. These are great safety features that enhance free diving with one size fits for everyone The DIVEROID app is designed to work without a phone signal, and airplane mode while diving is suggested. The app shows all the necessary information you need and you can quickly see the dive time, depth, temperature, and ascending time all at a glance","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uPQAfyaTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIVEROID","source_asin":"B08H7DB3CD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172045","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H7DB3CD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H7DB3CD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1172046,"name":"Decibullz - Custom Molded Earphone Adapters (100-RED, Red)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618D7YM9OoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easily and quickly molded to the exact shape of your ears, Decibullz custom earphone adapters create a perfect fit that will never hurt and never fall out. Shaping the Decibullz thermoplastic molds is easy! Simply heat the molds in hot water, snap them onto your earphones, and shape them to your ears. When done you will have a perfect fitting earphone made just for you! Decibullz are also re-moldable so you can keep molding them until you get the exact fit you are looking for. Decibullz were created so you can take your music with you no matter what you're doing. Whether it's running, working out, or relaxing at the cafe Decibullz allow you to listen to what you love while doing what you love. Compatibility: The Decibullz Adapters are only compatible with standard earphones that use silicone tips and have a straight nozzle. If your earphones are not listed they have not been tested and may or may not be compatible. BZ100 Compatibility The following earphones have been tested and will fit the BZ100 adapters. -Jaybird Blue buds X -Jaybird Freedom Sprint -Plantronics Backbeat GO 2 -Sony: HBH-IS800 -Skull candy Smoking' Buds -Skull candy Titan -LG Tone Pro HBS-750 -LG Tone Ultra HBS-800 -Samsung Galaxy S4 Earphones -Samsung Galaxy S5 Earphones BZ200 Compatibility The following earphones have been tested and will fit the BZ200 adapters. -Soul Republic JAX -Soul Republic AMPS -Beats by Drew Ur Beats, -Beats by Drew Tour -Ear pollution Plugs -Ear pollution Crew -JVC: Marshmallow The following earphone brands are not compatible with Decibullz adapters: Shure, Kirsch, Bose and Apple. Note: While the Decibullz Molded Earphone Adapters will improve the comfort and fit of your earphones they may not improve sound isolation and may change sound quality. If you are looking for improved sound quality and the best noise isolation check out the Decibullz Contour Custom Molded Earphones.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618D7YM9OoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decibullz","source_asin":"B00L1S5HGW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172046","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L1S5HGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L1S5HGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
