window.products.push({"id":1172151,"name":"Cables Direct Online RG6 500ft Dual Shield Coaxial Cable, 18 AWG Copper Clad Steel Conductor, Foam PE Core, 60% Aluminum Braid, PVC Jacket, Reel in Bo","category":"electronics","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lX7iPNJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The frequency range of our RG6 coaxial cable is from 0 MHz to 3 GHz, which makes it suitable for applications such as cable TV, satellite TV, and broadband internet. Conductor - True 18 AWG (1.02mm) made of Solid Copper-Clad Steel, with dielectric made of foam polyethylene with a diameter of around 0.18 inches, which provides a low-loss signal path for the cable. The jacket is made of PVC (Polyvinyl Chloride) material, which provides durability and protection against physical damage, moisture, and sunlight. The dual shielding consists of an aluminum foil shield and a braided copper shield. The aluminum foil shield is wrapped around the dielectric, while the braided copper shield covers the aluminum foil shield. The braided copper shield has a coverage of 60%, which provides excellent protection against electromagnetic interference (EMI) and radio frequency interference (RFI). The impedance of our RG6 coaxial cable is 75 Ohms, which makes it ideal for transmitting high-frequency signals with minimal signal loss.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lX7iPNJVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cables Direct Online","source_asin":"B07582Z8CD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172151","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07582Z8CD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07582Z8CD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
