window.products.push({"id":1172188,"name":"Ultimate Ears MEGABLAST Portable Waterproof Wi-Fi and Bluetooth Speaker with Hands-Free Voice Control - Graphite","category":"electronics","retail price":245.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g-bmtf3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet Ultimate Ears MEGABLAST, our most powerful portable Wi-Fi/Bluetooth speaker with big, bassy 360° sound and hands-free voice control. Now with Amazon Alexa built-in, you and your crew can blast tunes, discover new music, order takeout, and more, with just the power of your voice. Do it all at home or on-the-go, even take calls without killing the music whenever connected to Wi-Fi or a mobile hotspot. MEGABLAST is waterproof, rugged, and stunning too — go from cocktail party to the pool party with confidence and style. Just say it to play it with MEGABLAST from Ultimate Ears. • Enjoy intensely rich 360° sound, stunning clarity, and heart-pounding bass wherever you go • Control your music hands-free through far-field voice recognition and Amazon Alexa built-in • Up to 330 ft / 100 m range on Wi-Fi and 150 ft / 45 m on Bluetooth lets you move around freely • MEGABLAST is IP67 rated and can be immersed in water up to 1 m for 30 minutes • Add new features as they become available through the Ultimate Ears app ULTIMATE SOUND - Our biggest, loudest, and most beautiful speaker yet, Ultimate Ears MEGABLAST is insanely powerful. Blasting 360° intensely rich sound with stunning clarity and deep, heart-pounding bass, this Wi-Fi/Bluetooth speaker will bring your music to life in its full glory wherever you take it.  ULTIMATE VOICE CONTROL - Ultimate Ears MEGABLAST comes with hands-free Amazon Alexa built right in. Just ask Alexa to blast tunes, discover new music, crank the volume, find new restaurants -–or try any of Alexa’s crazy skills. Use Alexa anywhere your speaker goes, all you need is Wi-Fi or a mobile hotspot.  THE MUSIC NEVER STOPS - Ultimate Ears MEGABLAST brings Wi-Fi to the portable speaker party and connects directly to the cloud. Enjoy fast, seamless music streaming and a bigger range to roam and dance. Anyone can DJ. And even take calls without stopping the music and killing the vibe.  SERIOUSLY WATERPROOF AND VIRTUALLY INDESTRUCTIBLE - Ultimate Ears MEGABLAST is rugged and seriously waterproof. Never worry about going easy on it. From the shower to the pool party, the summer BBQ to the winter slopes–your music will always be on point. Wi-Fi and Bluetooth enabled: Use the Alexa Voice Service at home or on the go whenever connected to Wi-Fi or a mobile hotspot or stream music via Bluetooth from your phone","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g-bmtf3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ultimate Ears","source_asin":"B075WKS4D8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172188","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075WKS4D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B075WKS4D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1172189,"name":"2xhome - New TV Wall Mount Bracket & Three(3) Triple Shelf Package","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Oob4q08AL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our unique knobs function can lock the bracket in a place, and 15 degrees of TILT(Up and down function) , it could avoid any reflections from windows/light. Our mount is universal model, it is compatible with 99% of 30 inches to 85 inches (Max VESA Dimensions 718 x 450mm) of all major manufacture models. Our mount is classified as heavy duty mount, since it can hold up to 176Lbs TV. The bracket comes complete with a handy spirit level fitted to the wall plate, ensure you get a perfectly level fit. Comes with FREE basic FITTING HARDWARE, and easy to use full instruction manual for quick and easy mounting. FAQ: How do I know if this wall mount will fit my TV? Step1: Take a measurement of the height and the width of your TV, to make sure that your TV dimensions are LARGER than the bracket dimensions shown below – you do not wish the bracket to be visible one your TV is in place. BRACKET DIMENSIONS: 28.3inches (Width) x 18.5inches (Height)/ 720mm (Width) x 470mm (Height) Step 2: Please also measure the screw hold pattern on back of your TV. If the mount holes from the left to right are equal or less than 27.5 inch (W) and from the top to bottom equal or less than 17.7inch OR UP TO 700mm(Width) x 450mm(Height), then this item is guaranteed works for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Oob4q08AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"2xhome","source_asin":"B00N31OX5Q","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172189","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N31OX5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N31OX5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
