window.products.push({"id":1172289,"name":"Simrad 000-14077-001 GO7 XSR Chartplotter/Fishfinder with Radar Display","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ECzP68QgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for day boats, runabouts and smaller sport boats, the GO Series delivers the expanded capabilities of larger units in a compact and affordable design to fulfill all of your boating needs. The GO Series feature super-bright, multi-touch widescreen displays for navigation, charting, sonar, and weather. The GO Series brings familiar functionality and quick and intuitive operation with pinch-to-zoom and click-and-drag functions commonly found on smartphones and tablets. With fully customizable viewing panels, you are free to create favorite screen combinations. Behind a super-bright, multi-touch widescreen display lies a built-in GPS receiver, wireless connectivity, and industry standard NMEA 2000 networking. Connect with smartphones and tablets, control your onboard sound system, monitor engine data, and choose from an array of built-in sonar technology to cruise with confidence and find fish like a pro. The Semrad GO XSR chart plotter navigation display is a perfect way to expand the capabilities of sport boats, cruisers, and smaller center consoles with plug-and-play support for Semrad Broadband Radar and Halo Pulse Compression radar systems. Behind a super-bright, multi-touch widescreen display lies a built-in GPS receiver, Go Free Wi-Fi, and industry standard NMEA 2000 connectivity. Connect with smartphones and tablets, control your onboard sound system, monitor engine data, and choose from an array of built-in sonar technology to cruise with confidence and find fish like a pro. Fish Reveal Smart Target View makes fish easier to see on Down Scan Imaging by combining crystal-clear CHIRP sonar fish targets with superior, high-resolution views of bottom detail, structure and bait fish. C-MAP Easy Routing and Avionics Dock-to-Dock Auto routing allows you to navigate faster and easier with automatic route planning. Menu activated, the feature automatically plots the shortest and safest course based on a boat's draft, beam and height, creating a route around a landmass, shoals and other fixed navigational hazards. Requires C-MAP MAX-N+ charts, Avionics+ or Avionics Platinum charts. C-MAP Navigation Palette enhances the readability of C-MAP charts, especially near shore, making it easy to tell where the boat is in relation to a channel, nevoid, ledges and drop-offs, or a point of land. Motor Guide Xi5 Trolling Motor Control lets you operate the Xi5 trolling motor from the touchscreen of your Semrad display, making it easy to maintain your current position or navigate to a new one without leaving the helm. Navigation options include navigating to cursor, a heading, waypoint, along a route, or pre-defined turn pattern. The GO XSR is a full-featured chart plotter, with support for the widest available range of cartography options including C-MAP MAX-N, Avionics, Insight, Insight Genesis, and NV Digital Charts. Navigate confidently to destinations near and far, with the flexibility to choose charts that best fit your needs and location. Set and record those destinations easily with simple waypoint management: mark waypoints with a touch, and assign meaningful names that make it easy to look up your desired destination whether you've mapped out ten places or a thousand. Go Free Wi-Fi enables Avionics Plotter Sync waypoint synchronization, available with a compatible Avionics chart card and update subscription. The Semrad GO XSR is a full-featured radar display with plug-and-play connectivity to Semrad Broadband 3G, Broadband 4G, and Halo Pulse Compression radar systems. Cruise confidently through crowded harbors, navigate safely in poor visibility, keep an eye on distant weather cells, and find flocks of feeding birds that hint at good fishing spots. Automatic tuning helps to provide a clear radar picture in any conditions, while radar overlay combines radar data with navigational charts for an easy-to-interpret view of your surroundings. The Semrad GO XSR is fully customizable to suit your vessel and your favorite on-water activities -- from power boating, to fishing, to water sports. Customize your home screen with shortcuts to the features you use most, and personalize it with your choice of wallpaper. Adjustable split-screen views and customizable panel layouts let you see everything you need on-screen at once, whatever your activity. Designed for power boaters, Trip Intel technology tracks and displays the key information you need to plan safe and enjoyable days on the water. Make smart decisions with fuel range overlaid on charts, easy access to current and future tide levels, and a detailed history of your previous trips including the route you took and how your boat performed. Enjoy the most up-to-date charts on the water with Avionics Sonar Chart Live. Available with Avionics charts, this feature creates a depth-contour overlay using live sonar data from your display's built-in sounder. The results are shown on your GO XSR display and updated in real-time as you fish or cruise. With a high-speed GPS ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ECzP68QgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simrad","source_asin":"B078NJ4H4M","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172289","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078NJ4H4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B078NJ4H4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
