window.products.push({"id":1172349,"name":"Mini Bluetooth Keyboard Wireless Keyboard - Ultra-Slim, Silent, Multi-Device, Illuminated, 7 Colors RGB, for Apple iPad iPhone Samsung Tablet Phone Sm","category":"electronics","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q7ql4YriL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you troubled with the following problems? ▷Always lose the USB plug of wireless keyboard? ▷Can't see the keyboard at night? ▷The keyboard is too big to put in the bag? Then come and try our keyboard! Fulfill all your keyboard needs! Package List 1.Bluetooth Wireless Keyboard*1 2.Instruction manual*1 3. Certificate of conformity*1 4.Type-C charging cable*1 How To Use Before using the keyboard for the first time, first charge the keyboard for 3-4 hours. 1. Turn the switch in the upper right corner of the keyboard to \"ON\". Press the adjacent round button to enter the Bluetooth matching mode. (with the bluetooth light flashing) 2. Open the \"Settings\" of the electronic equipment and connect to [Runelves keyboard] via \"Bluetooth\". (If you get a random pairing number, import it with the keyboard to confirm.) 3. Pairing is now complete. (The bluetooth light will stop blinking) 4. If the keyboard is not operated for more than 10 minutes, it will go dormant, but it will be restored after pressing any button. 5. Multi-Device Link & switching methods 1)Press and hold \"Fn+1\" for 3 seconds, the light will flash, then follow the above connection method. 2)Press and hold \"Fn+2\" for 3 seconds, the light will flash, then follow the above connection method. 3)Press and hold \"Fn+3\" for 3 seconds, light flashes, then follow the above connection method. There is an instruction manual placed in the package, if the instruction manual is not understandable, please feel free to contact us, we will help you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q7ql4YriL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RunElves","source_asin":"B0B5LDPJLD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172349","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5LDPJLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5LDPJLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
