window.products.push({"id":1172484,"name":"Stainless Volume Control Wall Plate 100W 25/70.7V","category":"electronics","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51REvByBycL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Saga Elite Stainless Steel Volume Control Wall Plate (100W 25/70V) For standard PA, paging, or background music applications, no commercial sound installation is complete without a means to control the volume. The Stainless Steel Volume Control Wall Plate features a marked dial that gives you all the control to crank up or tone down the sound as needed. This premium-quality volume control combines dependable performance with low insertion loss, and excellent frequency response. A Steel of a Deal Stainless steel is the ideal alternative to wood or plastic wall plates. It’s tough enough to endure hard blows or knocks, and it resists corrosion and rust which makes it suitable for most installations. Daisy Chain Away Most commercial installs require the use of multiple speakers to provide sound to a large or wide spread area. 70V compatibility makes this Volume Control the best means to consistently control the volume for all connected speakers simultaneously. Precise Adjustments The volume dial features 10 attenuation steps with a positive off position. To prevent damage to the switch, there is no “stop” between the “off” position and the “10” position. The dial is prominently featured on the face of the plate with clearly marked levels from 0-10. Single-Gang Installation The SAG0242 is connected to 16 gauge speaker wire via Phillips head screw terminals. It includes a removable terminal block and is designed for use with 70 volt systems. Also, the Volume Control features an attached transformer. It fits in a single-gang box, and features a stainless steel plate with stamped and filled numbers and heavy-duty black plastic knob. Each terminal will accommodate up to 16awg stranded wire. We recommend it be mounted in a \"backless\" junction box. If an enclosed box is to be used, we recommend a deep box (3.5 inches in depth). Mounting screws are included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51REvByBycL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAGA","source_asin":"B07DVSY917","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172484","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DVSY917","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DVSY917","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
