window.products.push({"id":1172586,"name":"SOUNDSTREAM T5.152 Tarantula T5 15 Inch 2600 Watt Max 2 Ohm Subwoofer (2 Pack)","category":"electronics","retail price":399.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Uwo-D-xLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Pair of Soundstream 15\" 5200W Tarantula T5 Series Dual 2 Ohm Subwoofer T5.152  This listing includes: (2) T5.152 15\" Subwoofer (12) Hole Covers (2) Owner's Manual (2) Owner's Registration Card  In recent years, Tarantula subwoofers have evolved to meet various performance and placement goals, keeping your, the Soundstream fanatic, suggestions in mind. However, more often than not, we hear your calls to bring back a legend. For 2017, we're proud to re-introduce the old favorite, Tarantula T5. For this next generation, we made a few changes and several improvements.  Improvements include direct connect wire leads, over saturated 12mm top plate and t-yoke, & double-stitched cone to high-density polyether foam surround for improved sound quality. Key components that you expect from T5 still remain; big ass 1,000w 3\" voice coil, triple-stack magnet structure, high-density Spruce pulp sub-cone, and the iconic black-on-black Soundstream spider.  Overcompensating Motor Structure for Increased Magnetic Strength 12mm T-Yoke & Top Plate Improve Low-Frequency Dynamics Vented T-Yoke & Frame Reduces Voice Coil Heat Build-up Non-Magnetic Non-Resonate Die-Cast Aluminum Frame 3\" 4-Layer Voice Coil w/ Direct Connect Wire Increases Power Handling High-Temperature Tolerance Adhesives Resist Thermal Failure Non-Transfer Spruce Pulp Cone w/ UV & Chemical Protection Stitched and Glued Surround/Cone Joints for Strongest Bonding Extended Excursion Polyether Foam Surround w/ UV & Chemical Protection Dual Poly-Cotton Suspension Dampen Violent Accelerations 1-pc Gasket/Trim Ring w/ Concealed Mounting Holes Included  Features per Speaker: 1300W RMS 2600W MAX Efficiency: 88dB 3\" 2 Ohm Dual Voice Coil  Dimensions: Mounting Depth: 9.25\" Cutout Diameter: 14.125\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Uwo-D-xLL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soundstream","source_asin":"B015G8B3Y2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172586","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015G8B3Y2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B015G8B3Y2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
