window.products.push({"id":1172855,"name":"New Sports Wireless Bluetooth Headphones, Retail Package","category":"electronics","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e49nJZ96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The headphones develop a rich, deep high quality sound. Built in Microphone for easy call answering . This Bluetooth headphone has convenient access buttons to play, pause, fast forward and control volume as well as a built-in mic so that you can always stay connected anywhere. design with outstanding comfort and pure wireless sound. enjoy bluetooth stereo and hands free. Product Features: Bluetooth V2.1 + EDR, CSR solution,HSP,HFP,A2DP,AVRCP Technology: Lets you wirelessly connect to compatible devices, including select Apple iPhone 5s/5c/4s/4c/3/2 iPAD iPod, Android Smart phone; Samsung Galaxy S4/S3 Note2/3; Galaxy Tablet; Nokia Toshiba Sony and BlackBerry Smart cell phone and devices; most Mac and Bluetooth-enabled PC laptops Tablet and desktops. Built-in microphone: Allows clear communication; Enables use as a headset. Music and phone controls ensure ease of use. Built-in rechargeable lithium-polymer battery: With Li-battery enables up to 5-6 hours of talk time or audio playback, Standby time up to 180 hours. 20Hz - 20kHz frequency response: 64 ohms impedance Supports wireless in-game chatting and music streaming When connected to your PC, mobile phone, TV or PlayStation 3 (PS3) for versatile use. Remote buttons make it easy to control media playback. Space-saving foldable headband Allows simple transport and storage in the included hard travel case Included micro USB-to-USB 2.0 charge cable Makes it easy to replenish the battery's power. Passive noise reduction Up to 15dB blocks background sounds for an immersive listening experience. Noise Blackout with dual microphone technology promotes optimal call quality. 119dB sensitivity (@ 1kHz) Delivers powerful sound. Have Separate control key: Button function:V- /next music/V+/previous music/pause/play","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e49nJZ96L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beyution","source_asin":"B00M95KNJW","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1172855","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00M95KNJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00M95KNJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
